00:58:02.630 --> 00:58:04.830
I never let a single mosquito bite him.

00:58:04.920 --> 00:58:06.430
I took care of him with utmost care.

00:58:06.730 --> 00:58:08.000
And who the fuck do you think you are

00:58:08.020 --> 00:58:09.330
to hurt my beating heart?!

00:58:09.350 --> 00:58:11.370
Jam was trespassing.

00:58:11.390 --> 00:58:12.690
You first said it was a thief!

00:58:13.030 --> 00:58:14.530
You're the most deceitful bastard ever.

00:58:14.730 --> 00:58:16.810
It's a damn shame that I trusted you!

00:58:17.020 --> 00:58:18.160
You've never wondered

00:58:18.180 --> 00:58:20.410
