00:58:55.610 --> 00:58:56.340
You're damn right.

00:58:56.360 --> 00:58:58.230
What else do you expect, huh?!

00:58:58.250 --> 00:58:59.820
Insult me all you want,

00:58:59.840 --> 00:59:02.540
