00:59:13.050 --> 00:59:14.370
It's someone like you

00:59:15.030 --> 00:59:16.500
whom I call worthless.

00:59:17.280 --> 00:59:18.490
You're a worthless piece of shit!

00:59:18.730 --> 00:59:19.670
Ha!

00:59:23.470 --> 00:59:24.240
Whoa!

00:59:24.810 --> 00:59:25.540
Whoa!

00:59:28.690 --> 00:59:29.690
Ah!

00:59:40.220 --> 00:59:41.690
